FIRST INFORMATION REPORT
District: Amritsar   Police Station: Chheharta   Year: 2026   FIR No: 0067/2026
Date of FIR: 3 Feb 2026   Time: 04:50 hrs
Acts & Sections: NDPS Act Section 21, 29 and Arms Act 25
Place of Occurrence: Naka near GT Road, Chheharta, Amritsar
Complainant: SI Gurpreet Singh (Police Station Chheharta)
Details of Accused: Harjinder Singh alias Bobby s/o Balwinder Singh, r/o Village Vadala; Manpreet Kaur w/o Harjinder Singh.
Brief facts: During naka checking on 02-02-2026 at 11:30 PM, a Royal Enfield motorcycle PB 02 CX 3345 was stopped. 250 grams of heroin and Rs. 1.5 lakh cash was recovered from Harjinder Singh. One .32 bore pistol was recovered. Harjinder disclosed that supplier Kulwant Singh alias Kala (mobile 9815123456) supplies drugs. Two witnesses Jaswant Singh and Rakesh Kumar signed the recovery memo.
Investigating Officer: Inspector Baljit Kaur
